        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x^2+1)^2-2x^2$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^4+1&=x^4+2x^2+1-2x^2\\\\x^4+1&=(x^2+1)^2-2x^2.\\end{align*}$$",
